<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia's Banque du Sud launches investment fund.</title>
<headline>Tunisia's Banque du Sud launches investment fund.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia's Banque du Sud has received a request from the Finance Ministry to launch a venture capital investment company named SUD-SICAR, the fund said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>SUD-SICAR will have capital of five million dinars ($5 million).</p>
<p>($1=one dinar)</p>
